title: It's not style that matters, but sameness of style
type: text/vnd.tiddlywiki

<<<
many stylistic choices are arbitrary, and purely a matter of personal preference. Choosing a style guide means building agreements in areas where we have strong differences of opinion about issues of little significance. It's not style that matters, but sameness of style.
<<<